    <li>toiletries</li>
    <li>household cleaning or general use products</li>
    <li>newspapers and magazines.</li>
</ul>
<p>These benchmarks don't apply to businesses that mainly sell liquor, fuel=
 or cooked food.</p>
<h2 id=3D"ato-Whatareperformancebenchmarks"><a id=3D"Whatareperformancebenc=
hmarks62" class=3D"anchor"></a>What are performance benchmarks</h2>
