<p>Performance benchmarks use information reported on tax returns for the 2=
023=E2=80=9324&nbsp;financial year and are updated each year. This is the m=
ost current data.</p>
<p>The benchmarks show ranges of business income to business expenses. Use =
these benchmarks to <a href=3D"https://www.ato.gov.au/businesses-and-organi=
sations/income-deductions-and-concessions/small-business-benchmarks/compare=
-your-business-now">compare your performance</a> against similar businesses=
.</p>
<h2 id=3D"ato-Keybenchmarkrange"><a id=3D"Keybenchmarkrange92" class=3D"anc=
hor"></a>Key benchmark range</h2>
<p>Cost of sales to turnover is the key benchmark range for this industry. =
